# Lammert ARC HTS v2.1 PF ("Interesting autoreactor"): no labels in the file, wiring worked out from its math:
#   in1 temperature (x100), in2 power out, in3 load, in4 fuel, in5 "store" enable (any signal that is sent every tick)
#   in6 performance lever, in7 over/undervolt lever, in8 reset (left unwired = off); out3 is a display.
reactor in1 reactor.temperature_out
reactor in2 reactor.power_value_out
reactor in3 reactor.load_value_out
reactor in4 reactor.fuel_out
reactor in5 reactor.load_value_out
reactor out1 reactor.set_fissionrate
reactor out2 reactor.set_turbineoutput
reactor out3 none
